{"id":"g0130","title":"Bursae articulationis humeri-Komplex","description":"Anwendung des anthroposophischen Organpräparats zur Behandlung von Bursitis, z. B. im Rahmen einer Schultergelenksarthrose oder bei Überbelastung.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WALA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Bursae articulationis humeri-Komplex bovis Gl. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Bursitis "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a0326","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Im Bereich der großen Gelenke. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2 x/Wo. bis tgl. 1 Amp. D8–D30 s.c. je nach Entzündungsgrad. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Komedikation mit "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0050.html","id":"10718","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Apis mellifica"}]},{"type":"text","text":" D3–D30 WALA/WELEDA. "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bei akuter Bursitis auch "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0124.html","id":"10719","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bryonia"}]},{"type":"text","text":" D3 Dil. (Rezepturpräparat), bei chronischer "},{"type":"inline","id":"10720","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Fluorit"}]},{"type":"text","text":" D6 oder D12 Trit. (Rezepturpräparate) , ggf. auch "},{"type":"inline","id":"10721","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Iscucin® Salicis"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Amp. WALA (vgl. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0118.html","id":"10722","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Viscum album (nicht onkologisch)"}]},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Es gibt nicht für alle Bursen der großen Gelenke Einzelpräparate, sondern pars pro toto Bursae articulationis humeri-Komplex, da diese Bursa beim Rind anatomisch am besten ausgebildet ist. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtende Ärzte"}]},{"type":"text","text":": FR, Red. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Akute Bursitis mehrerer Schleimbeutel im Schultergelenk "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a2041","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Meist im Rahmen einer Schultergelenksarthrose. "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bei Überlastungen, Sport."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Diagnostik in Form von Sonographie und/oder MRT."}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2–3 x/Wo. 1 Amp. D30 s.c. im Bereich des Schultergelenkes, auch in Kombination mit "},{"type":"inline","id":"10723","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Articulatio humeri"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Gl D30 Amp. WALA, "},{"type":"inline","id":"10724","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Arnica/Levisticum D3 comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Amp. WELEDA (vgl. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0093.html","id":"10725","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Arnica/Levisticum comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0755.html","id":"10726","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Rhus toxicodendron comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Amp. WALA, "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0126.html","id":"10727","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bryonia/Stannum"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Amp. WALA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Verbesserung der Schmerzen und der Beweglichkeit. Behandlung kann sich auch über Wochen hinziehen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 10 Tg. bis mehrere Wochen. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Keine. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Krankengymnastik. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": JU. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"R0130","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Literatur "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"literature-R0130","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Roemer F. Organpräparate Kompendium. 6. Aufl. Bad Boll/Eckwälden: WALA Heilmittel GmbH 2008; 16–21, 46–63."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Roemer F. Therapiekonzepte der Anthroposophischen Medizin. 1. Aufl. Stuttgart: Karl F. Haug Verlag 2014; 72, 268."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Steiner R. Vortrag vom 2. Januar 1924. In: Steiner R. Physiologisch-Therapeutisches auf Grundlage der Geisteswissenschaft. GA 314. 3. Aufl. Dorna